Model weights and tokenizer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The image downloads the pi0.5 base weights (lerobot/pi05_base) at build time.
Those weights are covered by their own upstream terms, not by this license.

The PaliGemma tokenizer (google/paligemma-3b-pt-224) is not included in this
package. It is a gated repository, distributed by Google under the Gemma terms
of use. Fetch it yourself with scripts/fetch-tokenizer.sh after accepting those
terms and being granted access.

